The profile gate now explains itself where somebody can see it. It dispatched Volto's `addMessage`, and Volto 19 mounts no component that renders those, so the explanation reached the store and nothing else; it is a toast now. It also speaks up on every redirect rather than once per destination, so being sent back to the same form says why again, and it names each field by the label the form gives it rather than by its schema name. @ericof
